### 1. CRITICAL: `extractReasoningMiddleware.ts` — Buffer never flushed on stream end (line ~90-106)

**Failure scenario:** Stream ends while inside a reasoning block (no closing tag `` or `</reasoning>` received). All buffered reasoning content is silently dropped.

```typescript
// Lines 70-90 in transform():
while (true) {
  const nextTag = isReasoning ? closingTag : openingTag
  const startIndex = getPotentialStartIndex(buffer, nextTag)
  if (startIndex == null) {
    publish(buffer)  // publishes content before potential tag
    buffer = ''
    break
  }
  // ... tag found logic
}
// NO FLUSH AFTER LOOP — if stream ends here, buffer content is lost
```

